mend Active LTS or Maintenance LTS releases. I didn't check the official nodejs.org release page, so confirm the newest version there.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1109d544-97b2-4d2e-99ba-614b43676cc1","uuid":"1cbee0fc-4083-4ed5-9123-af3d8eae0279","timestamp":"2026-10-10T10:12:54.245Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"latest stable Node.js version release","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EFsqeiGs3gotZbdXDPQSdE","content":[{"title":"Node.js 13.6.0 Released","url":"https://mag-en.osdn.jp/mag/376"},{"title":"Open In App","url":"https://geeksforgeeks.org/node-js-versions"},{"title":"endoflife.date","url":"https://endoflife.date/nodejs"},{"title":"releasealert.dev","url":"https://releasealert.dev/chocolatey/Node%20JS?page=5"},{"title":"Node.js-Releases, Versionen und End-of-Life-Termine (EOL)","url":"https://www.versio.io/de/product-release-end-of-life-eol-openjs-foundation-nodejs.html"},{"title":"fetch node release","url":"https://releasealert.dev/npmjs/_/fetch-node-release"},{"title":"Latest Stable","url":"https://versionlog.com/nodejs/"},{"title":"Update to latest stable release 6.1.0","url":"https://forgejoroute-communishift-forgejo.apps.fedora.cj14.p1.openshiftapps.com/rpms/nodejs/commit/86719465d66b2f9bcff9ff4845d647633a322a67"},{"title":"node js 4","url":"https://www.yld.com/blog/node-js-4"}]},"The most recent version I found is Node.js 26.8.2, but the sources conflict on its status and the page may be a few weeks old.\n\n- **Newest release:** A versio.io release table, last updated September 16, 2026, lists 26.8.2 as the latest version of the 26 line, dated 2026-09-09.\n- **Older snapshot:** A versionlog.com page shows 26.4.0 as the latest stable release, dated 24 June 2026. That is older than the versio.io data.\n- **LTS lines:** The same versio.io table lists 24.21.0 (Krypton, LTS) and 22.23.2 (Jod, LTS) as the latest releases in those lines